    <MESSAGE value="Add silent selection to radio buttons." />
    <MESSAGE value="Add silent selection to radio buttons.&#10;&#10;RadioButtonOverlay.setSelected and RadioGroup.setSelected change the&#10;selection without firing onChange, like setChecked and setOn. setSelected&#10;(false) also deselects a button that has no group. RadioGroup.add now takes&#10;a button out of its old group, and no longer leaves two buttons selected&#10;when the added one was already selected." />
    <MESSAGE value="Ordered layouts ignore bringToFront." />
    <MESSAGE value="Ordered layouts ignore bringToFront.&#10;&#10;In VerticalLayout, HorizontalLayout and GridLayout the child order sets&#10;each child's position, so dragging a draggable child moved it to the end of&#10;the layout. These layouts now leave the order alone. StackLayout still&#10;raises the child, since its order is the drawing order." />
    <MESSAGE value="Guard SplitContainer's divider and pane slots." />
    <MESSAGE value="Guard SplitContainer's divider and pane slots.&#10;&#10;Removing the divider now throws, like TabContainer's tab strip. Replacing a&#10;pane or setting it to null detaches the old pane, setting a pane that is on&#10;the other side moves it instead of showing it twice, and bringToFront no&#10;longer moves a dragged pane out of its slot." />
    <MESSAGE value="Show a scrollbar on long dropdown lists." />
    <MESSAGE value="Show a scrollbar on long dropdown lists.&#10;&#10;A dropdown list with more items than maxVisibleRows now draws a themed&#10;scrollbar along its right edge. The thumb can be dragged and a press on&#10;the track jumps there; rows stop short of the bar so pressing it never&#10;picks a row. Styled through getScrollBarStyle. Docs updated." />
    <MESSAGE value="Popups follow the element that opened them." />
    <MESSAGE value="Popups follow the element that opened them.&#10;&#10;Window.showPopup takes an optional anchor element. Each frame after the&#10;update pass the popup moves with its anchor, stays inside the window&#10;(flipping above or below when one side runs out of room), and closes&#10;when the anchor is removed, disabled, or scrolled or clipped out of&#10;view. Dropdowns, color and date pickers, menus, context menus and the&#10;spelling suggestion popup all pass their anchor. Added PopupFollowDemo&#10;and updated the docs." />
    <MESSAGE value="Clip container children to rounded corners." />
    <MESSAGE value="Clip container children to rounded corners.&#10;&#10;A container with a corner radius now clips its children to the rounded&#10;shape instead of its bounding rectangle. ScrollContainer scrollbars are&#10;shortened just enough to stay inside the rounded corners. Docs updated." />
    <MESSAGE value="Controls with a click listener no longer drag their container." />
    <MESSAGE value="Controls with a click listener no longer drag their container.&#10;&#10;A press handed up to a draggable ancestor now stops at the first element&#10;that listens for clicks, so pressing a button on a draggable panel clicks&#10;it without moving the panel. Updated the javadocs and docs to match, and&#10;fixed a stale SplitContainer comment." />
